streams the 11.07 GB Flux schnell fp8 checkpoint from the D: SATA HDD on every run and takes 71 s on one idle RTX 4060 Ti (measured 2026-10-02: four runs 71.0 to 71.1 s, all exact against .expected; GPU 1.46 s and host 1.27 s of 71.9 s, and a plain read of the file takes 80.8 s), over test-run.ps1's fixed 60 s wall budget; run by hand with its .vmargs: tools/codex-vm.exe -kernel <cdx> -output <out> -mem 3072 -headless -gpu-files build-output/diffusion-models
